  "bug": {
    "actual_behavior": "两个目标均完成技能更新，但随后出现 GBK 解码异常和 WinError 5，安装器以退出码 1 结束，临时目录残留",
    "additional_notes": null,
    "evidence": [
      "subprocess reader reported UnicodeDecodeError for GBK; cleanup reported WinError 5 on a Git pack index file"
    ],
    "expected_behavior": "远程检查安装完成后应清理临时目录并以成功状态退出",
